  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The complex shows linkage isomerism in the presence of ambidentate ligands.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Co</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msub><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;shows linkage isomerism, because&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;ligand is ambidentate ligand.</p>",
